1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,719
Bhai ne bill bharne ka button dabaya,

2
00:00:02,719 --> 00:00:05,049
aur karz phir bhi badh gaya.

3
00:00:05,049 --> 00:00:08,157
Button ka naam tha minimum due. Usne socha,

4
00:00:08,157 --> 00:00:10,099
aaj ka kaam ho gaya.

5
00:00:10,099 --> 00:00:13,594
Asal mein usi raat ek meter chalu ho gaya.

6
00:00:13,594 --> 00:00:17,090
Woh meter mahine dar mahine chalta raha, bilkul chupchaap.

7
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:20,262
Der raat, Bhai bistar par phone dekh raha hai.

8
00:00:20,262 --> 00:00:23,786
Card ki app khuli hai, upar laal rang mein bill.

9
00:00:23,786 --> 00:00:26,606
Neeche button hain, total due aur minimum due.

10
00:00:26,606 --> 00:00:29,425
Minimum due wala amount bahut chhota dikhta hai.

11
00:00:29,425 --> 00:00:31,540
Bhai muskura kar wahi dabata hai.

12
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:34,591
Kuch mahine baad Behen uska statement dekhti hai.

13
00:00:34,591 --> 00:00:37,260
Naya kharcha toh usne kiya hi nahi.

14
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:41,073
Phir bhi bill pehle se bada hai. Behen poochti hai,

15
00:00:41,073 --> 00:00:45,267
tune paisa bhara tha na? Bhai kehta hai, haan, har mahine,

16
00:00:45,267 --> 00:00:46,030
time par.

17
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:48,086
Toh yahan kuch sawaal uthte hain.

18
00:00:48,086 --> 00:00:51,170
Minimum due bharne par asal mein hota kya hai?

19
00:00:51,170 --> 00:00:53,569
Bill saalon tak khatam kyun nahi hota?

20
00:00:53,569 --> 00:00:56,996
Aur card ka byaaj baaki loans se itna bhaari kyun?

21
00:00:56,996 --> 00:01:00,080
Aaj inhe kahani ke saath, seedhi bhasha mein samjhenge.

22
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:03,025
Aur end mein bahar nikalne ka raasta bhi dekhenge.

23
00:01:03,025 --> 00:01:05,643
Kyunki yeh jaal sirf Bhai ka nahi hai.

24
00:01:05,643 --> 00:01:08,261
Festive sale ka season hai, phone, TV, fridge,

25
00:01:08,261 --> 00:01:10,225
sab card par aa raha hai.

26
00:01:10,225 --> 00:01:13,170
Isliye yeh kahani shayad aapke ghar ki bhi hai.

27
00:01:13,170 --> 00:01:16,178
Shuru se shuru karte hain. Festive sale chal rahi thi.

28
00:01:16,178 --> 00:01:18,584
Bhai ka purana phone slow ho gaya tha.

29
00:01:18,584 --> 00:01:21,592
Online naya phone dikha, bada discount, upar se card offer.

30
00:01:21,592 --> 00:01:24,900
Usne socha, abhi le leta hoon, paisa baad mein de dunga.

31
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:26,609
Yahan tak sab theek tha.

32
00:01:26,609 --> 00:01:29,343
Credit card asal mein bank ka udhaar hai.

33
00:01:29,343 --> 00:01:32,761
Aap aaj kharchte ho, bank dukaandaar ko paisa deta hai.

34
00:01:32,761 --> 00:01:35,496
Mahine ke end mein bank statement bhejta hai.

35
00:01:35,496 --> 00:01:38,230
Statement yaani poore mahine ke kharche ka hisaab.

36
00:01:38,230 --> 00:01:39,885
Ab ek badhiya cheez samjhiye.

37
00:01:39,885 --> 00:01:43,527
Agar poora bill time par bhar do, toh koi byaaj nahi.

38
00:01:43,527 --> 00:01:46,838
Isse interest-free period kehte hain, yaani muft udhaar ka samay.

39
00:01:46,838 --> 00:01:50,480
Card companies yeh samay 20 se 50 din tak deti hain.

40
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:50,806
Socho,

41
00:01:50,806 --> 00:01:54,388
bank aapko lagbhag 50 din tak muft paisa de raha hai.

42
00:01:54,388 --> 00:01:56,994
Na byaaj, na koi fees. Bas shart hai,

43
00:01:56,994 --> 00:01:58,948
poora bill time par bharna hai.

44
00:01:58,948 --> 00:02:02,530
Yeh shart hi poore khel ki chaabi hai, isko yaad rakhiyega.

45
00:02:02,530 --> 00:02:05,933
Phir statement aaya. Bill phone ki keemat jitna tha.

46
00:02:05,933 --> 00:02:08,201
Salary aane mein abhi der thi,

47
00:02:08,201 --> 00:02:10,847
aur ghar ka kiraaya bhi dena tha.

48
00:02:10,847 --> 00:02:13,872
App ne ek aasaan raasta dikhaya, minimum due.

49
00:02:13,872 --> 00:02:16,140
Bill ka bas chhota sa hissa.

50
00:02:16,140 --> 00:02:18,261
Minimum due yaani woh chhoti rakam,

51
00:02:18,261 --> 00:02:21,088
jo bhar do toh bank defaulter nahi bolega.

52
00:02:21,088 --> 00:02:24,622
Late fees nahi lagegi, account chalta rahega. Bhai ko laga,

53
00:02:24,622 --> 00:02:28,510
bank khud yeh option de raha hai. Toh zaroor safe hoga.

54
00:02:28,510 --> 00:02:31,660
Aur logic samajh bhi aata hai. Papa hamesha kehte the,

55
00:02:31,660 --> 00:02:34,810
kist time par bharo, record achha rahega. Bhai ne socha,

56
00:02:34,810 --> 00:02:37,330
minimum bhi toh time par bhar raha hoon.

57
00:02:37,330 --> 00:02:40,480
Baaki paisa agle mahine de dunga. Isme galat kya hai?

58
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:43,523
Galat woh hai jo app bada karke nahi likhti.

59
00:02:43,523 --> 00:02:47,243
Jaise hi poora bill nahi bhara, muft udhaar ka samay khatam.

60
00:02:47,243 --> 00:02:50,963
Sirf baaki paise par nahi, poore bill par byaaj lagta hai.

61
00:02:50,963 --> 00:02:53,330
Aur aksar kharidaari ke din se hi.

62
00:02:53,330 --> 00:02:57,462
Matlab Bhai ne jo socha tha, ulta hua. Usne socha tha,

63
00:02:57,462 --> 00:02:59,716
baaki rakam par thoda byaaj lagega.

64
00:02:59,716 --> 00:03:03,472
Asal mein naye kharche par bhi muft samay nahi milta.

65
00:03:03,472 --> 00:03:05,726
Jab tak purana bill saaf nahi,

66
00:03:05,726 --> 00:03:07,980
har nayi swipe par seedha byaaj.

67
00:03:07,980 --> 00:03:11,304
Ab agla sawaal. Card ka byaaj itna bhaari kyun hai?

68
00:03:11,304 --> 00:03:14,628
Iske liye pehle Papa ki PPF wali soch samajhte hain.

69
00:03:14,628 --> 00:03:16,291
Kyunki wahi hamara normal hai,

70
00:03:16,291 --> 00:03:18,950
jis se hum har byaaj ko naapte hain.

71
00:03:18,950 --> 00:03:22,198
Papa ki almari mein PPF ki passbook hai.

72
00:03:22,198 --> 00:03:26,258
PPF par lagbhag 7.1 percent saal ka byaaj milta hai.

73
00:03:26,258 --> 00:03:29,912
Papa ise achha return maante hain. Ab ulta socho.

74
00:03:29,912 --> 00:03:33,160
Card par aap byaaj lete nahi, dete ho.

75
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:36,967
Aur card ka byaaj PPF wale byaaj se kai guna hota hai.

76
00:03:36,967 --> 00:03:40,139
Statement mein yeh mahine ke hisaab se likha hota hai.

77
00:03:40,139 --> 00:03:43,312
Mahine ka chhota sa percent, sunne mein halka lagta hai.

78
00:03:43,312 --> 00:03:45,850
Saal bhar jodo toh aankh khul jaati hai.

79
00:03:45,850 --> 00:03:48,134
Upar se yeh byaaj compounding wala hai.

80
00:03:48,134 --> 00:03:51,722
Compounding yaani byaaj par bhi byaaj. Is mahine jo byaaj laga,

81
00:03:51,722 --> 00:03:54,006
woh agle mahine bill mein jud gaya.

82
00:03:54,006 --> 00:03:56,616
Agle mahine byaaj us bade bill par lagega.

83
00:03:56,616 --> 00:03:58,900
Bill har mahine thoda phool jaata hai.

84
00:03:58,900 --> 00:04:02,885
Socho karz ek balti hai, jise aap khaali karna chahte ho.

85
00:04:02,885 --> 00:04:05,783
Aap har mahine ek lota paani nikaalte ho.

86
00:04:05,783 --> 00:04:09,767
Par upar se nal khula hai, byaaj ka nal. Jitna nikaalo,

87
00:04:09,767 --> 00:04:13,390
utna wapas aa jaata hai. Balti kabhi khaali nahi hoti.

88
00:04:13,390 --> 00:04:15,400
Aur abhi kahani khatam nahi hui.

89
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:18,415
Byaaj aur fees par sarkar GST bhi leti hai.

90
00:04:18,415 --> 00:04:20,760
GST yaani services par lagne wala tax.

91
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:24,110
Card ke byaaj aur fees par yeh 18 percent hai.

92
00:04:24,110 --> 00:04:26,120
Yaani byaaj ke upar bhi tax.

93
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:30,292
Ab Bhai ke statement ki lines padhiye. Finance charges, yaani byaaj.

94
00:04:30,292 --> 00:04:33,705
Uske neeche GST. Kabhi late fees, uspar phir GST.

95
00:04:33,705 --> 00:04:37,877
Bhai ko laga tha woh phone ki keemat chuka raha hai.

96
00:04:37,877 --> 00:04:41,290
Asal mein woh byaaj aur tax chuka raha tha.

97
00:04:41,290 --> 00:04:43,439
Phir ek mahine salary der se aayi.

98
00:04:43,439 --> 00:04:46,508
Minimum due bhi miss ho gaya. Ab late fees lagi,

99
00:04:46,508 --> 00:04:49,578
uspar GST laga, aur byaaj toh chal hi raha tha.

100
00:04:49,578 --> 00:04:52,340
Thodi si der ne bill aur bada kar diya.

101
00:04:52,340 --> 00:04:54,211
Aur ek cheez chupchaap hoti hai.

102
00:04:54,211 --> 00:04:57,329
Late payment aapke credit score mein record ho jaata hai.

103
00:04:57,329 --> 00:04:59,824
Credit score yaani aapki udhaar wali report card.

104
00:04:59,824 --> 00:05:02,631
Kal ko home loan ya car loan lena ho,

105
00:05:02,631 --> 00:05:04,190
toh bank yahi dekhta hai.

106
00:05:04,190 --> 00:05:07,753
Ab sabse bada sawaal. Bhai har mahine paisa bhar raha hai.

107
00:05:07,753 --> 00:05:10,021
Phir bhi bill khatam kyun nahi hota?

108
00:05:10,021 --> 00:05:12,288
Iska jawaab chhupa hai is baat mein,

109
00:05:12,288 --> 00:05:14,880
ki aapka bhara hua paisa jaata kahan hai.

110
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:16,643
Jab aap minimum due bharte ho,

111
00:05:16,643 --> 00:05:19,582
bank pehle apna hissa kaatata hai. Pehle tax, phir fees,

112
00:05:19,582 --> 00:05:21,052
phir byaaj. Jo bachta hai,

113
00:05:21,052 --> 00:05:23,109
wahi asli udhaar se kam hota hai.

114
00:05:23,109 --> 00:05:24,873
Asli udhaar ko principal kehte hain,

115
00:05:24,873 --> 00:05:26,930
yaani jo aapne asal mein kharcha tha.

116
00:05:26,930 --> 00:05:30,053
Minimum due chhota hai, aur byaaj ka hissa bada.

117
00:05:30,053 --> 00:05:33,522
Toh principal mein har mahine bas thoda farak padta hai.

118
00:05:33,522 --> 00:05:35,951
Jaise aap treadmill par daud rahe ho.

119
00:05:35,951 --> 00:05:39,420
Paseena poora aa raha hai, par jagah wahi ki wahi.

120
00:05:39,420 --> 00:05:42,119
Kuch banks statement mein yeh bhi batate hain,

121
00:05:42,119 --> 00:05:45,156
ki sirf minimum bharoge toh bill kab khatam hoga.

122
00:05:45,156 --> 00:05:48,193
Bhai ne woh line pehli baar dhyan se padhi.

123
00:05:48,193 --> 00:05:51,230
Jawaab mahino mein nahi tha. Jawaab saalon mein tha.

124
00:05:51,230 --> 00:05:54,812
Socho, ek phone jo kuch saal mein purana ho jaayega.

125
00:05:54,812 --> 00:05:58,751
Uska karz shayad usse bhi lamba chalega. Naya phone aa jaayega,

126
00:05:58,751 --> 00:06:02,333
aur purane phone ki kist abhi bhi chal rahi hogi.

127
00:06:02,333 --> 00:06:04,840
Yahi hai minimum due ka asli jaal.

128
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:09,231
Aur is beech zindagi rukti nahi. Agle mahine Mummy ki dawai,

129
00:06:09,231 --> 00:06:11,626
school ki fees, shaadi ka shagun.

130
00:06:11,626 --> 00:06:14,021
Thoda aur card par chala gaya.

131
00:06:14,021 --> 00:06:16,816
Purane bill par naya bill chadh gaya.

132
00:06:16,816 --> 00:06:19,610
Ab minimum due bhi bada dikhne laga.

133
00:06:19,610 --> 00:06:22,220
Mummy ne chai rakhte hue poocha, beta,

134
00:06:22,220 --> 00:06:24,831
har mahine paisa kahan ja raha hai?

135
00:06:24,831 --> 00:06:28,187
Bhai ke paas jawaab nahi tha. Salary aati thi,

136
00:06:28,187 --> 00:06:31,543
aur pehle hafte mein card mein chali jaati thi.

137
00:06:31,543 --> 00:06:33,780
Bachat dheere dheere khatam ho gayi.

138
00:06:33,780 --> 00:06:35,376
Yahi sabse badi keemat hai.

139
00:06:35,376 --> 00:06:37,611
Byaaj sirf bank ko nahi ja raha.

140
00:06:37,611 --> 00:06:39,526
Woh aapki bachat kha raha hai.

141
00:06:39,526 --> 00:06:41,760
Jo paisa SIP mein ja sakta tha,

142
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:43,356
emergency fund ban sakta tha,

143
00:06:43,356 --> 00:06:45,910
woh har mahine byaaj mein ud raha hai.

144
00:06:45,910 --> 00:06:49,173
Toh galti kahan hui? Galti phone kharidna nahi thi.

145
00:06:49,173 --> 00:06:52,074
Galti thi minimum due ko bill bharna samajhna.

146
00:06:52,074 --> 00:06:54,249
Minimum due bill bharna nahi hai.

147
00:06:54,249 --> 00:06:56,425
Woh bas bank ko batana hai,

148
00:06:56,425 --> 00:06:58,600
ki main abhi bhaaga nahi hoon.

149
00:06:58,600 --> 00:07:02,203
Ab bahar kaise niklein? Sabse seedha raasta, poora bill bharo,

150
00:07:02,203 --> 00:07:04,364
har baar. Card utna hi chalao,

151
00:07:04,364 --> 00:07:06,886
jitna mahine ke end tak chuka sako.

152
00:07:06,886 --> 00:07:11,930
Tab woh 50 din tak ka muft udhaar sach mein aapke kaam aata hai.

153
00:07:11,930 --> 00:07:15,322
Agar bill bada hai aur ek saath nahi bhar sakte,

154
00:07:15,322 --> 00:07:18,376
toh use EMI mein badlo. Bank se baat karo,

155
00:07:18,376 --> 00:07:22,107
ya app mein option dhoondo. EMI yaani fixed kist, fixed samay.

156
00:07:22,107 --> 00:07:25,500
Byaaj aksar kam, aur end kab hoga, pehle se pata.

157
00:07:25,500 --> 00:07:27,594
Ek aur raasta hai balance transfer.

158
00:07:27,594 --> 00:07:30,735
Yaani purana bill kisi aur card par shift karna,

159
00:07:30,735 --> 00:07:32,828
jahan kuch samay kam byaaj ho.

160
00:07:32,828 --> 00:07:35,271
Iski fees aur sharten dhyan se padho.

161
00:07:35,271 --> 00:07:39,110
Warna ek jaal se nikal kar naye jaal mein pahunch jaoge.

162
00:07:39,110 --> 00:07:42,974
Ya phir personal loan lekar card ka poora bill ek saath chuka do.

163
00:07:42,974 --> 00:07:45,352
Personal loan ka byaaj bhi kam nahi hota,

164
00:07:45,352 --> 00:07:47,433
par aksar card se halka padta hai.

165
00:07:47,433 --> 00:07:51,000
Aur loan ke baad card ko phir se bharna shuru mat karo.

166
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:53,661
Ek chhoti si aadat bhi kaam aati hai.

167
00:07:53,661 --> 00:07:56,986
Card ka auto-debit poore bill par lagao, minimum par nahi.

168
00:07:56,986 --> 00:08:00,312
Behen yahi karti hai, uska card suvidha hai, karz nahi.

169
00:08:00,312 --> 00:08:03,970
Yeh investment advice nahi hai, bas hisaab ki seedhi baat hai.

170
00:08:03,970 --> 00:08:07,583
Kahani ka nichod yeh hai. Minimum due ek suvidha hai,

171
00:08:07,583 --> 00:08:10,835
raasta nahi. Woh aaj ki pareshani se bachata hai,

172
00:08:10,835 --> 00:08:13,726
par kal ka bill bada kar deta hai.

173
00:08:13,726 --> 00:08:17,700
Jis din poora bill bharna mushkil lage, raasta badlo, button nahi.

174
00:08:17,700 --> 00:08:20,288
Agli video mein ek aur jaal kholenge,

175
00:08:20,288 --> 00:08:23,616
jo is festive season mein har jagah dikhta hai.

176
00:08:23,616 --> 00:08:27,683
No cost EMI. Kya woh sach mein no cost hota hai?

177
00:08:27,683 --> 00:08:31,750
Tab tak apna card statement dhyan se padhiye, khaaskar chhote akshar.

178
00:08:31,750 --> 00:08:34,592
Ab aap batao, comments mein seedha jawaab.

179
00:08:34,592 --> 00:08:38,652
Aapne kabhi sirf minimum due bhara hai? Haan ya na,

180
00:08:38,652 --> 00:08:42,712
bas itna likh do. Kisi ki aisi kahani pata ho,

181
00:08:42,712 --> 00:08:45,960
toh woh bhi likhna, doosron ke kaam aayegi.
